red units, normalizedPounds, normalizedCostUsdPerLb, stock totals, and movements; and the projections response contains wastageRatio, remaining stock, daily, weekly, monthly, quarterly, six-month and annual projection fields, and movements.","when":"The client requests GET /api/v1/inventory and GET /api/v1/inventory/projections."},{"given":"An authenticated client submits the contract example receipt of 2 tons at USD 360 per ton.","id":"AC-REQ-2.2","level":"api","then":"The response status is 201 and the response fields retain enteredQuantity 2 and enteredUnit ton while reporting normalizedPounds 4000 and normalizedCostUsdPerLb 0.18.","when":"The client calls POST /api/v1/inventory/receipts."},{"given":"An authenticated client and saved rations exist.","id":"AC-REQ-2.3","level":"api","then":"The response status is 200 and the response list includes ration names, intended animal ranges, nutrition and cost values, ingredient entered units, normalized quantities, proportions, and ingredient pricing fields.","when":"The client requests GET /api/v1/rations."},{"given":"An authenticated client submits a valid ration with ingredients expressed in tons.","id":"AC-REQ-2.4","level":"api","then":"The response status is 201 and the returned ration retains each enteredUnit and includes normalized ingredient quantities, ingredient costs, dryMatterPercent, energyMcalPerLb, and costUsdPerLb.","when":"The client calls POST /api/v1/rations."},{"given":"An authenticated client submits valid nutrition or animal-range constraints.","id":"AC-REQ-2.5","level":"api","then":"The response status is 200 and the response candidates contain ingredient proportions, cost, nutrition values, tradeoff, and Candidate status.","when":"The client calls POST /api/v1/rations/optimization."},{"given":"An authenticated client explicitly accepts an existing optimization candidate.","id":"AC-REQ-2.6","level":"api","then":"Each response status is 200 and each response contains the requested candidateId and it